       CBL INITCHECK(STRICT)
      * INITCHECK(STRICT): Z IS INITIALIZED ON ONE PATH TO THE DISPLAY
      * STATEMENT BUT NOT ON THE OTHER, SO THE COMPILER WARNS (RETURN
      * CODE 4). Y HAS A VALUE CLAUSE.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZE149N.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  Y PIC 9 VALUE 3.
       01  Z PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF Y > 5
               MOVE 2 TO Z
           END-IF.
           DISPLAY Z.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM ZE149N.
